Here's where you're going to have to make a decision about
how to play the game. Nethack has a plethora of spoiler
documents that explains how everything works. You have to decide
if you'll have more fun playing the game and trying to figure things
out for yourself, or if you want the help of the spoilers which
tells you how to do these things.

I'll give you a hint as an example. Shops are useful for IDing
items even when you they have no useful stuff. Shopkeepers will
offer you a specific price for each and every scroll if you drop
it in a shop that normally sells scrolls (general stores and
bookstores for spells). Virtually every scroll that is priced
under $50 for resale is useful. 

Another hint. Never use an scroll,potion, or ring if you don't
know what it is. It's playing Russian Roulette.

-I do not know the spell of identify. So how do I identify
